Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:04.02,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Destiny is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:06.10,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}osore shitte mo
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:10.61,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}subete no mirai togirenu you ni
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:15.07,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}tomosu honoo ga
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:21.24,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}inochi no kirameki (Destiny will begin tonight)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:57.28,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le destin est mien
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:02:59.41,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si la peur me retient
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:03.83,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je ne laisserai pas nos futurs être brisés
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:10.09,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je tirerai un fil de lumière
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.05,0:03:20.01,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Chaque fois que je surmonte la douleur
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.01,0:03:29.73,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Mon cœur devient plus affûté (N’abandonne jamais)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:38.07,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Au bout de ce destin sans fin
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:41.87,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je fais le serment devant cette océan lumineux
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.54,0:03:44.54,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Que je tiendrai bon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:46.71,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si je tombe ici
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.71,0:03:52.25,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je lèguerai le sens de la vie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.05,0:03:55.01,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le ciel s’effondre
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:57.30,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si le firmament me tombe dessus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.30,0:04:01.97,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je briserai les desseins d’un dieu fou
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:04.02,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le destin est mien
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:06.10,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si la peur me retient
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:10.61,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je ne laisserai pas nos futurs être brisés
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:15.07,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}J’allume une flamme
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:21.24,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}L’étincelle de la vie (Le destin commencera ce soir)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:20.03,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Même si tu penses que je fais face
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.03,0:22:25.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Ma tête est remplie d'espoir
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.28,0:22:34.17,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}D'un quelconque endroit autre qu'ici
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.21,0:22:40.21,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Même si tu penses que je souris
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.21,0:22:45.55,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Intérieurement et pendant tout ce temps
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.55,0:22:53.85,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Je m'interroge sur mon destin
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.48,0:23:00.44,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Je pense à
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.44,0:23:05.36,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Toutes les choses
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:10.29,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Que j'aimerais faire
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.29,0:23:14.58,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Dans ma vie
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.58,0:23:19.38,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Je suis un rêveur
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.38,0:23:24.59,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Un lointain songeur
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.59,0:23:30.10,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Rêvant d'espoir
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:34.23,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Dès à présent
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:20.03,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.03,0:22:25.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.28,0:22:34.17,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Of some place other than here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.21,0:22:40.21,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.21,0:22:45.55,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.55,0:22:53.85,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm wondering about my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.48,0:23:00.44,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.44,0:23:05.36,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}All the things
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:10.29,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'd like to do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.29,0:23:14.58,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}In my life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.58,0:23:19.38,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm a dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.38,0:23:24.59,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}A distant dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.59,0:23:30.10,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Dreaming far away
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:34.23,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}From today

